## API ENDPOINTS

### Sequential Knowledge Graph Service (Port 8099)
- GET /api/v1/health - Service health and capabilities
- POST /api/v1/knowledge-graph - Process single document
- POST /api/v1/knowledge-graph/batch - Batch processing
- GET /api/v1/knowledge-graph/:doc_id - Retrieve stored graph

